     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-GB\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">Hello friends and colleagues (and apologies for cross posting!),<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">Here is some information and important dates as we creep closer to ISEC24. The links and information for the items below will start appearing on the new ISEC website over the next two weeks (</span><a href=\"https://statisticalecology.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://statisticalecology.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492954948000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ByHcnIyxHtRRWaNWncchD\">https://statisticalecology.org/</a><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">,\r\n the dedicated website for ISEC conferences from now on). <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">Please share this information with your friends, colleagues, and students</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><u></u><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> </span><u></u></u></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">Looking forward to seeing you all in Swansea in the summer<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">Luca and the ISEC organising committee.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm 0cm 1.0pt 0cm\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"border:none;padding:0cm\"><b><u><u></u><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> </span><u></u></u></b></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><u></u><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> </span><u></u></u></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:#548235\">ISEC<sub>2024</sub>: The International Statistical Ecology Conference\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:#548235\">15<sup>th</sup> – 19<sup>th</sup> July 2024<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:#548235\">Swansea, UK<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;color:#548235\"><u></u> <u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><u></u><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> </span><u></u></u></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><span style=\"color:#548235\">Keynote Speaker<u></u><u></u></span></u></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><u></u><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> </span><u></u></u></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">We are excited to announce that we have confirmed a fantastic collection of keynote speakers for the conference this year (details on the website):<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li style=\"margin-left:0cm\">Dr. Marie Auger-Méthé (University of British Columbia, Canada)<u></u><u></u></li><li style=\"margin-left:0cm\">Prof. John Fieberg (University of Minnesota, USA)<u></u><u></u></li><li style=\"margin-left:0cm\">Prof. Rachel McCrea (Lancaster University, UK)<u></u><u></u></li><li style=\"margin-left:0cm\">Dr. Matthew Schofield (University of Otago, NZ)<u></u><u></u></li><li style=\"margin-left:0cm\">Dr. Elise Zipkin (Michigan State University, USA)<u></u><u></u></li></ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><u></u><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> </span><u></u></u></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><span style=\"color:#548235\">Registration and accommodation<u></u><u></u></span></u></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li style=\"margin-left:0cm\">Registration will open in the next 2 weeks with a registration deadline of 15<sup>th</sup> June. There will be a ‘standard delegate rate’ and a (reduced) ‘student delegate rate’ and\r\n the costs will be in line with previous rates. There will be no ‘early bird’ rate.  We have arranged a block booking for on-site university accommodation. These rooms will be held until the end of April, which is after decisions will be announced about abstracts\r\n (see below). This accommodation is, of course, optional.<u></u><u></u></li></ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><u></u><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> </span><u></u></u></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><u></u><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> </span><u></u></u></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><span style=\"color:#548235\">Abstract submission<u></u><u></u></span></u></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><u></u><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> </span><u></u></u></b></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li style=\"margin-left:0cm\">Abstract submission will open in the next 2 weeks and will close on Friday 22<sup>nd</sup> of March. Abstract will be submitted vias the website (link to appear soon). Decisions about\r\n abstracts will be communicated by early April. There will be standard talks and posters.<u></u><u></u></li></ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><u></u><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> </span><u></u></u></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><u></u><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> </span><u></u></u></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><span style=\"color:#548235\">Workshops<u></u><u></u></span></u></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><u></u><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> </span><u></u></u></b></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li style=\"margin-left:0cm\">We are now welcoming proposals for workshops! If you are interested in proposing a workshop, please send the following information to Luca Borger (l.borger [at] <a href=\"http://swansea.ac.uk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://swansea.ac.uk&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492954948000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0_EKlc8t6C1Mw3uJWAVRIR\">swansea.ac.uk</a>) and\r\n Chris Sutherland (css6 [at] <a href=\"http://st-andrews.ac.uk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://st-andrews.ac.uk&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492954948000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0XG0niTegzyY68fDXTnKOt\">st-andrews.ac.uk</a>):<u></u><u></u></li><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"circle\">\r\n<li style=\"margin-left:0cm\">Title<u></u><u></u></li><li style=\"margin-left:0cm\">Short workshop description (&lt;300 word)<u></u><u></u></li><li style=\"margin-left:0cm\">Intended audience<u></u><u></u></li><li style=\"margin-left:0cm\">Whether you are proposing a ½ day or a full day workshop<u></u><u></u></li></ul>\r\n<li style=\"margin-left:0cm\">We will charge a small fee for workshops which will be used to cover the registration of workshop instructors and refreshments.   <u></u><u></u></li></ul>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm 0cm 1.0pt 0cm\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"border:none;padding:0cm\"><b><u><u></u><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> </span><u></u></u></b></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><u></u><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> </span><u></u></u></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">Chris<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></i></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:black\">While I may be sending this email outside of my normal office hours, I have no expectation to receive a reply outside of\r\n yours.<u></u><u></u></span></i></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:#000066\"><u></u> <u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:#000066\">Chris Sutherland\r\n</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:#000066\">(he/him/his)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0000cc\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\">Reader</span></i><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0000cc\"><u></u><u></u></span></i></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\">Centre for Research into Ecological &amp; Environmental Modelling<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\">School of Mathematics and Statistics<br>\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\">University of St Andrews</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:gray\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\">W:\r\n<a href=\"https://www.sutherlandecology.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.sutherlandecology.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492954949000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0YBrV5rKF1INruJ__EsrFF\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">website</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0000cc\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\">E:\r\n</span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:#0563c1\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">cs...@st-andrews.ac.uk</span></a></span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0000cc\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><img border=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"120\" style=\"width:6.25in;min-height:1.25in\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/hmecology/attach/3162dea25948e/image001.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"lesson image\"><span><u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
    ]
